{"title": "The Deathstalker Mantle", "pageid": 4765, "url": "https://bg3.wiki/wiki/The_Deathstalker_Mantle", "categories": ["Bugs", "Cloaks", "Rare items"], "html": "<div class=\"mw-content-ltr mw-parser-output\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\"><p class=\"mw-empty-elt\"> \n</p>\n<div class=\"bg3wiki-tooltip-box bg3wiki-tooltip-gradient-rare\"><figure class=\"mw-default-size mw-halign-right\" typeof=\"mw:File/Frameless\"><a href=\"/wiki/File:The_Deathstalker_Mantle_Faded.png\" class=\"mw-file-description\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/2/2d/The_Deathstalker_Mantle_Faded.png/300px-The_Deathstalker_Mantle_Faded.png.webp, /w/images/2/2d/The_Deathstalker_Mantle_Faded.png 1.5x\"><img alt=\"The Deathstalker Mantle image\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/2/2d/The_Deathstalker_Mantle_Faded.png/300px-The_Deathstalker_Mantle_Faded.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"300\" height=\"300\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/2/2d/The_Deathstalker_Mantle_Faded.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a><figcaption></figcaption></figure>\n<p><a class=\"mw-selflink selflink\"><span style=\"color: #01BFFF ;\">The Deathstalker Mantle</span></a> is a rare <a href=\"/wiki/Cloaks\" title=\"Cloaks\">Cloak</a> that turns the wearer <a href=\"/wiki/Invisible_(Condition)\" title=\"Invisible (Condition)\">Invisible</a> for 2 turns after killing an enemy.\n</p>\n<div style=\"font-size:110%; font-family:'Linux Libertine', 'Georgia', serif; display: flex; flex-wrap: wrap;\">\n<div style=\"opacity: 0.5; margin: 0.5em 0.5em 0.5em 0;\"><span typeof=\"mw:File\"><span><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/5/5b/Description_Icon.png/24px-Description_Icon.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/5/5b/Description_Icon.png/36px-Description_Icon.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/5/5b/Description_Icon.png 2x\"><img src=\"/w/images/thumb/5/5b/Description_Icon.png/24px-Description_Icon.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></span><a href=\"/w/images/5/5b/Description_Icon.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></div>\n<div class=\"bg3wiki-blockquote-text\" style=\"width:100px; flex-grow: 1; font-style: italic;\">\n<p>Let hill and hollow be a door<br>To screams that last forevermore\n</p>\n</div></div>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Properties\"> Properties </span></h2>\n<div class=\"bg3wiki-property-list\" style=\"margin-left: 7px\"> \n<ul><li><span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"mw-default-size bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Cloaks\" title=\"Cloaks\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/a/aa/Cloaks_Icon.png/25px-Cloaks_Icon.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/a/aa/Cloaks_Icon.png/38px-Cloaks_Icon.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/a/aa/Cloaks_Icon.png/50px-Cloaks_Icon.png.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Cloaks\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/a/aa/Cloaks_Icon.png/25px-Cloaks_Icon.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"25\" height=\"25\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/a/aa/Cloaks_Icon.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> <a href=\"/wiki/Cloaks\" title=\"Cloaks\">Cloaks</a></li>\n<li><span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"mw-default-size bg3wiki-icon bg3wiki-lightmode-drop-shadow\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><span><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/e/ef/Rarity_Icon.png/25px-Rarity_Icon.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/e/ef/Rarity_Icon.png/38px-Rarity_Icon.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/e/ef/Rarity_Icon.png 2x\"><img alt=\"Rarity: Rare\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/e/ef/Rarity_Icon.png/25px-Rarity_Icon.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"25\" height=\"25\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></span><a href=\"/w/images/e/ef/Rarity_Icon.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> Rarity: <span style=\"color: #01BFFF ;\">Rare</span></li>\n<li><span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"mw-default-size bg3wiki-icon bg3wiki-lightmode-drop-shadow\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><span><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/e/ea/Weight_Icon.png/25px-Weight_Icon.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/e/ea/Weight_Icon.png/38px-Weight_Icon.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/e/ea/Weight_Icon.png 2x\"><img alt=\"Weight: 0.5 kg (1 lb)\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/e/ea/Weight_Icon.png/25px-Weight_Icon.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"25\" height=\"25\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></span><a href=\"/w/images/e/ea/Weight_Icon.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> Weight: 0.5 kg (1 lb)</li>\n<li><span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"mw-default-size bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><span><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/2/26/Gold_Icon.png/25px-Gold_Icon.png.webp, /w/images/2/26/Gold_Icon.png 1.5x\"><img alt=\"Price: 190 gp\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/2/26/Gold_Icon.png/25px-Gold_Icon.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"25\" height=\"25\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></span><a href=\"/w/images/2/26/Gold_Icon.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> Price:  190  gp</li>\n<li><span class=\"bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><span><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/3/3c/Ico_stats.png/25px-Ico_stats.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/3/3c/Ico_stats.png/38px-Ico_stats.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/3/3c/Ico_stats.png 2x\"><img alt=\"Ico stats.png\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/3/3c/Ico_stats.png/25px-Ico_stats.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"25\" height=\"25\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></span><a href=\"/w/images/3/3c/Ico_stats.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span> <details class=\"bg3wiki-uid\">\n<summary>UID</summary>\n<code class=\"bg3wiki-uid-box\">UNI_DarkUrge_Bhaal_Cloak</code>\n</details> <span class=\"bg3wiki-uid-link\"><span class=\"mw-default-size bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"https://bg3.norbyte.dev/search?q=name:UNI_DarkUrge_Bhaal_Cloak\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noreferrer noopener\"><img alt=\"https://bg3.norbyte.dev/search?q=name:UNI_DarkUrge_Bhaal_Cloak\" src=\"/w/images/7/70/Search_icon.svg\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"14\" height=\"14\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></a></span></span> <details class=\"bg3wiki-uid\">\n<summary>UUID</summary>\n<code class=\"bg3wiki-uid-box\">dff731f7-d6da-403d-80cf-7f3d9cc7345b</code>\n</details> <span class=\"bg3wiki-uid-link\"><span class=\"mw-default-size bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"https://bg3.norbyte.dev/search?q=uuid:dff731f7-d6da-403d-80cf-7f3d9cc7345b\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noreferrer noopener\"><img alt=\"https://bg3.norbyte.dev/search?q=uuid:dff731f7-d6da-403d-80cf-7f3d9cc7345b\" src=\"/w/images/7/70/Search_icon.svg\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"14\" height=\"14\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></a></span></span> <details class=\"bg3wiki-uid\">\n<summary>Stats</summary>\n<code class=\"bg3wiki-uid-box\">UNI_DarkUrge_Bhaal_Cloak</code>\n</details> <span class=\"bg3wiki-uid-link\"><span class=\"mw-default-size bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"https://bg3.norbyte.dev/search?q=name:UNI_DarkUrge_Bhaal_Cloak+type:stat\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noreferrer noopener\"><img alt=\"https://bg3.norbyte.dev/search?q=name:UNI_DarkUrge_Bhaal_Cloak+type:stat\" src=\"/w/images/7/70/Search_icon.svg\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"14\" height=\"14\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></a></span></span></li></ul>\n</div> \n<h3><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Special\">Special</span></h3>\n<p>The wearer of this item gains:\n\n</p>\n<dl><dt><a href=\"/wiki/The_Shadow_Itself\" title=\"The Shadow Itself\">The Shadow Itself</a></dt><dd>Once per turn when you kill an enemy, shroud yourself in primeval darkness to become <span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"mw-default-size bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Invisible_(Condition)\" title=\"Invisible (Condition)\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/d/d7/Invisible_Condition_Icon.webp/25px-Invisible_Condition_Icon.webp, /w/images/thumb/d/d7/Invisible_Condition_Icon.webp/38px-Invisible_Condition_Icon.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/d/d7/Invisible_Condition_Icon.webp/50px-Invisible_Condition_Icon.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Invisible\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/d/d7/Invisible_Condition_Icon.webp/25px-Invisible_Condition_Icon.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"25\" height=\"25\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/d/d7/Invisible_Condition_Icon.webp\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> <a href=\"/wiki/Invisible_(Condition)\" title=\"Invisible (Condition)\">Invisible</a> for 2 turns.</dd></dl>\n<div style=\"clear: both;\"></div></div>    \n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Where_to_find\"> Where to find </span></h2>\n<div class=\"bg3wiki-tooltip-box\">\n<ul><li><a href=\"/wiki/Campsite_(Act_One)\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Campsite (Act One)\">Campsite (Act One)</a>: given to <a href=\"/wiki/The_Dark_Urge\" title=\"The Dark Urge\">The Dark Urge</a> Origin by <span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"mw-default-size bg3wiki-icon bg3wiki-round-image\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Sceleritas_Fel\" title=\"Sceleritas Fel\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/c/c3/Portrait_Sceleritas_Fel.png/25px-Portrait_Sceleritas_Fel.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/c/c3/Portrait_Sceleritas_Fel.png/38px-Portrait_Sceleritas_Fel.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/c/c3/Portrait_Sceleritas_Fel.png/50px-Portrait_Sceleritas_Fel.png.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Sceleritas Fel\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/c/c3/Portrait_Sceleritas_Fel.png/25px-Portrait_Sceleritas_Fel.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"25\" height=\"25\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/c/c3/Portrait_Sceleritas_Fel.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> <a href=\"/wiki/Sceleritas_Fel\" title=\"Sceleritas Fel\">Sceleritas Fel</a></li></ul>\n</div> \n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Notes\"> Notes </span></h2>\n<div class=\"bg3wiki-tooltip-box\">\n\n<p><i>Regarding The Shadow Itself:</i></p>\n<ul><li><b>The Shadow Itself</b> only triggers once per turn, and only does so if the character kills an enemy directly while in combat mode. Examples of kills that do not trigger this effect include, but are not limited to:\n<ul><li>Indirect kills, such as attacking an incendiary barrel that then burns a nearby enemy to death.<sup class=\"noexcerpt navigation-not-searchable\">[<a href=\"/wiki/bg3wiki:Verification\" title=\"bg3wiki:Verification\"><span aria-label=\"It seems to trigger when ...\" tabindex=\"0\" class=\"bg3wiki-help-tooltip\"><i>verify</i></span></a>]</sup></li>\n<li>Killing an opponent by sniper-shot with a bow, out of combat.</li>\n<li>A creature killed from the wearer's casting of <span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Cloud_of_Daggers\" title=\"Cloud of Daggers\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/3/3d/Cloud_of_Daggers_Icon.webp/20px-Cloud_of_Daggers_Icon.webp, /w/images/thumb/3/3d/Cloud_of_Daggers_Icon.webp/30px-Cloud_of_Daggers_Icon.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/3/3d/Cloud_of_Daggers_Icon.webp/40px-Cloud_of_Daggers_Icon.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Cloud of Daggers\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/3/3d/Cloud_of_Daggers_Icon.webp/20px-Cloud_of_Daggers_Icon.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/3/3d/Cloud_of_Daggers_Icon.webp\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> <a href=\"/wiki/Cloud_of_Daggers\" title=\"Cloud of Daggers\">Cloud of Daggers</a></li>\n<li><span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Sneak_Attack\" title=\"Sneak Attack\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/e/e0/Sneak_Attack_Melee_Icon.webp/20px-Sneak_Attack_Melee_Icon.webp, /w/images/thumb/e/e0/Sneak_Attack_Melee_Icon.webp/30px-Sneak_Attack_Melee_Icon.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/e/e0/Sneak_Attack_Melee_Icon.webp/40px-Sneak_Attack_Melee_Icon.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Sneak Attack\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/e/e0/Sneak_Attack_Melee_Icon.webp/20px-Sneak_Attack_Melee_Icon.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/e/e0/Sneak_Attack_Melee_Icon.webp\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> <a href=\"/wiki/Sneak_Attack\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Sneak Attack\">Sneak Attack</a> as a <a href=\"/wiki/Reaction_(Combat)\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Reaction (Combat)\">reaction</a>.<sup class=\"noexcerpt navigation-not-searchable\">[<a href=\"/wiki/bg3wiki:Verification\" title=\"bg3wiki:Verification\"><span aria-label=\"unsure if this occurs whe...\" tabindex=\"0\" class=\"bg3wiki-help-tooltip\"><i>verify</i></span></a>]</sup></li></ul></li>\n<li>If a 'homing' weapon such as <span class=\"nowrap bg3wiki-icontext-icon\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-itemicon bg3wiki-itemicon-uncommon\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Returning_Pike\" title=\"Returning Pike\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/c/c2/Pike_PlusOne_Unfaded_Icon.png/20px-Pike_PlusOne_Unfaded_Icon.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/c/c2/Pike_PlusOne_Unfaded_Icon.png/30px-Pike_PlusOne_Unfaded_Icon.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/c/c2/Pike_PlusOne_Unfaded_Icon.png/40px-Pike_PlusOne_Unfaded_Icon.png.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/c/c2/Pike_PlusOne_Unfaded_Icon.png/20px-Pike_PlusOne_Unfaded_Icon.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/c/c2/Pike_PlusOne_Unfaded_Icon.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span></span> <a href=\"/wiki/Returning_Pike\" title=\"Returning Pike\">Returning Pike</a> deals the killing blow to an enemy, then the weapon's return animation will cause the invisibility to end early.</li>\n<li>If the Dark Urge is played as origin and either <span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"mw-default-size bg3wiki-icon bg3wiki-round-image\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Alfira\" title=\"Alfira\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/4/42/Portrait_Alfira.png/25px-Portrait_Alfira.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/4/42/Portrait_Alfira.png/38px-Portrait_Alfira.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/4/42/Portrait_Alfira.png/50px-Portrait_Alfira.png.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Alfira\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/4/42/Portrait_Alfira.png/25px-Portrait_Alfira.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"25\" height=\"25\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/4/42/Portrait_Alfira.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> <a href=\"/wiki/Alfira\" title=\"Alfira\">Alfira</a> or <span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"mw-default-size bg3wiki-icon bg3wiki-round-image\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Quil\" title=\"Quil\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/1/15/Portrait_Quil_Grootslang.png/25px-Portrait_Quil_Grootslang.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/1/15/Portrait_Quil_Grootslang.png/38px-Portrait_Quil_Grootslang.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/1/15/Portrait_Quil_Grootslang.png/50px-Portrait_Quil_Grootslang.png.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Quil\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/1/15/Portrait_Quil_Grootslang.png/25px-Portrait_Quil_Grootslang.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"25\" height=\"25\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/1/15/Portrait_Quil_Grootslang.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> <a href=\"/wiki/Quil\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Quil\">Quil</a> are killed in camp by another (e.g., <span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"mw-default-size bg3wiki-icon bg3wiki-round-image\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Astarion\" title=\"Astarion\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/1/1b/Portrait_Astarion.png/25px-Portrait_Astarion.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/1/1b/Portrait_Astarion.png/38px-Portrait_Astarion.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/1/1b/Portrait_Astarion.png/50px-Portrait_Astarion.png.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Astarion\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/1/1b/Portrait_Astarion.png/25px-Portrait_Astarion.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"25\" height=\"25\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/1/1b/Portrait_Astarion.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> <a href=\"/wiki/Astarion\" title=\"Astarion\">Astarion</a>) before finishing the Long Rest, conversation options in camp next morning proceed as if the player character killed them, and Sceleritas still meets with them upon their next Long rest, but does not reward the cape.</li></ul>\n</div> \n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Bugs\"> Bugs </span></h2>\n<div class=\"bg3wiki-tooltip-box\">\n\n<p><i>Regarding The Shadow Itself:</i></p>\n<ul><li>There is a bug involving this item with the <a href=\"/wiki/Illithid_powers\" title=\"Illithid powers\">Illithid power</a> <span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Cull_the_Weak\" title=\"Cull the Weak\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/d/d1/Cull_the_Weak_Icon.webp/20px-Cull_the_Weak_Icon.webp, /w/images/thumb/d/d1/Cull_the_Weak_Icon.webp/30px-Cull_the_Weak_Icon.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/d/d1/Cull_the_Weak_Icon.webp/40px-Cull_the_Weak_Icon.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Cull the Weak\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/d/d1/Cull_the_Weak_Icon.webp/20px-Cull_the_Weak_Icon.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/d/d1/Cull_the_Weak_Icon.webp\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> <a href=\"/wiki/Cull_the_Weak\" title=\"Cull the Weak\">Cull the Weak</a>. If the equipping character has <b>The Shadow Itself</b> activated and kills a target, the effect does not activate (or immediately gets cancelled).</li></ul>\n</div> \n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Gallery\">Gallery</span></h2>\n<ul class=\"gallery mw-gallery-packed\">\n\t\t<li class=\"gallerybox\" style=\"width: 358px\">\n\t\t\t<div class=\"thumb\" style=\"width: 356px;\"><span typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/File:Bert-vanhengel-bert-vanhengel-bg3-capes-04.jpg\" class=\"mw-file-description\" title=\"3d model by Bert Vanhengel\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/c/ca/Bert-vanhengel-bert-vanhengel-bg3-capes-04.jpg/534px-Bert-vanhengel-bert-vanhengel-bg3-capes-04.jpg.webp, /w/images/thumb/c/ca/Bert-vanhengel-bert-vanhengel-bg3-capes-04.jpg/800px-Bert-vanhengel-bert-vanhengel-bg3-capes-04.jpg.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/c/ca/Bert-vanhengel-bert-vanhengel-bg3-capes-04.jpg/1067px-Bert-vanhengel-bert-vanhengel-bg3-capes-04.jpg.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"3d model by Bert Vanhengel\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/c/ca/Bert-vanhengel-bert-vanhengel-bg3-capes-04.jpg/534px-Bert-vanhengel-bert-vanhengel-bg3-capes-04.jpg.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"356\" height=\"200\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/c/ca/Bert-vanhengel-bert-vanhengel-bg3-capes-04.jpg\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></div>\n\t\t\t<div class=\"gallerytext\">3d model by Bert Vanhengel</div>\n\t\t</li>\n\t\t<li class=\"gallerybox\" style=\"width: 171.33333333333px\">\n\t\t\t<div class=\"thumb\" style=\"width: 169.33333333333px;\"><span typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/File:The_deathsta